    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, ground floor apartment to the Dublin 15 property market. Ideally located within the highly sought-after Green View development in Verdemont, this spacious apartment offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, and those looking to downsize in a well-connected and vibrant area. The location is truly second to none. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is just a short stroll away, providing an extensive range of retail outlets, restaurants, cafés, and entertainment facilities. The property is also conveniently situated near Coolmine railway station and is well serviced by Dublin Bus routes, ensuring easy access to the city and surrounding areas. For commuters, the nearby N3 road offers swift connectivity to the M50 motorway, Dublin city centre, and the wider national road network. Dublin Airport is also less than a 20-minute drive away, making this an ideal base for both work and travel.\nNo. 4 Green View is a superb two-bedroom ground floor apartment presented in excellent condition throughout, having been tastefully renovated by its current owners to offer modern comfort, generous natural light, and a highly desirable park-facing setting. Extending to approximately 63 sq.m, this stylish home combines space, practicality, and contemporary living. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, and a fully fitted modern kitchen. Both the living area and bedrooms benefit from sliding doors opening onto a large private south-facing patio, enjoying sunny aspects and stunning views over the adjacent green park area. There are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, along with a modern family bathroom. The property further benefits from excellent storage throughout. Additional features include ample parking, south-facing orientation, high-quality flooring, open-plan living accommodation, and built-in wardrobes. Situated within a quiet and secure development, No. 4 enjoys a highly sought-after location close to a host of local amenities and excellent transport links. This property presents an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, investors, or anyone seeking a bright turnkey home in a peaceful yet convenient setting. Following the recent success of sales within Verdemont, early interest is expected — don't miss this opportunity! Contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today on 086 8225318 or 01 554 1699 to arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures;\n- c. 63 sq.m\n- 2 Bed 2 Bath ground floor apartment\n- BER D1\n- Management fee c.2400 p/a\n- Renovated throughout\n- Electric heating\n- Overlooking a large green area\n- South facing orientation\n- Ample parking\n- Heaps of storage\n- Walking distance to Blanchardstown shopping centre\n- Easy access to public transport & all major routes\n- Primary and secondary schools in close proximity\n- Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers and investors\n- Viewing highly advised!\n\nDirections: Travelling from Blanchardstown Village, turn left at the main junction onto Snugborough Road. Continue to the roundabout and take the first exit in the direction of Coolmine. After a short distance, take the next right turn into Verdemont follow the road ahead, where No. 4 Green View is located in the block on your left."
      },
